PROTECTION TEST
A maintenance controller can protect:
four selected variables

during:
future disturbances.

If a causal variable is selected,
approximately:
85%
of the incoming perturbation
is repaired / buffered.

Selecting a noncausal proxy:
spends protection capacity

but does not:
protect the true state.

